|lead='''Biggs Darklighter''' is a [[Light]] [[Character]] released as a very-rare foil in [[Reflections]] in January 2000.<ref name="checklist">[https://res.starwarsccg.org/Resources/swccgcardlist4.0.pdf Complete Card List v4.0], pp. 28–32 (collecting compilation). Preserved copy: [https://web.archive.org/web/20261009184033/https://res.starwarsccg.org/Resources/swccgcardlist4.0.pdf Internet Archive].</ref><ref name="encyc">[https://res.starwarsccg.org/Resources/Star_Wars_CCG_Collecting_Encyclopedia_3.2.pdf SWCCG Collecting Encyclopedia 3.2], Reflections product entry (collecting reference). Preserved copy: [https://web.archive.org/web/20261008192828/https://res.starwarsccg.org/Resources/Star_Wars_CCG_Collecting_Encyclopedia_3.2.pdf Internet Archive].</ref> It is a foil printing of the [[Premiere]] card.<ref name="foil-face">[[:File:Reflections-Foil-L-Biggs-Darklighter-PSA-73826307-original.jpg|Original printed Reflections foil face]], PSA certification 73826307.</ref>
|lore=Piloted Red 3 at Battle of Yavin. Childhood friend of Luke. Led mutiny on ''Rand Ecliptic'' and theft of ''Ecliptic'' from shipyards on Bestine. ''Ecliptic'' Evaders emblem on helmet.<ref name="foil-face" />
|game_text=Adds 2 to power of anything he pilots. When piloting Red 3, also adds 1 to maneuver and draws one battle destiny if not able to otherwise.<ref name="foil-face" />
|versions={{Card versions/Biggs Darklighter (Premiere)}}
